>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>If you have failed subjects or backlogs in your degree, the best path is to clear them with a realistic timetable, build one useful skill beside your studies, and speak honestly about it, since many employers value steady progress.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short answer:</strong> Clear the papers first, and build one skill beside them.</li>
      <li><strong>Evidence:</strong> This page quotes no statistics or pay figures and was not built from fetched sources. Ten live notices and two conversations, as set out below, are the best way to get current local evidence.</li>
      <li><strong>Growth:</strong> Clear proof and finished work support an earlier path to financial freedom.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

